28942da0b445775c3d8e1cce2e\" data-fileno=\"3674420\" style=\"width:513.646px;height:408.5px;\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046f5f45999daa\"></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><b style=\"font-size:24px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">3. 인게임정보 연동 가이드</span></b><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">게임정보를 연동하고 채팅방에 들어가야 갤럼들끼리 서로 스탯을 확인할 수 있고,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">레츠도로만의 추가 기능(성장추이, 갤 평균 옵작수치 등)도 사용할 수 있음.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><a class=\"lnk\" href=\"https://www.blablalink.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">블라블라</span></a><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"> 인게임 프로필 초상화를 클릭하여 프로필 페이지로 이동.</span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg1.dcinside.com/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce88ffa1bd62531fb627d466152f0768651601e7f3d94f3c9adffb7d59ec2cb2bddfdd342decf9c8c930124f9f952131e0cd69a49f84a\" data-fileno=\"3674421\" style=\"width:369.356px;height:421.5px;\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046c60f52b4a9aee\"></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">우측 상단의 \"자물쇠 아이콘\"을 클릭하여 SHIFTYPAD 설정 페이지로 이동.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg1.dcinside.com/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce88ffa1bd62531fb627d466152f0768651601e7f3d94f3c9adffb7d59ec2cb2dd4fcd643d6c79eda3a65ed02a34dcd873d8549e5a49b\" data-fileno=\"3674422\" style=\"width:352.039px;height:289.5px;\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046ec348c3f223\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">SHIFTYPAD 숨김 설정에서 다음 항목들을 \"모두에게 공개\"로 설정:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"><br></span></p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">• 홈페이지에 게임 카드(기본 정보)를 표시합니다\n</span><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">• SHIFTYPAD에 전초기지 정보 표시하기\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">• SHIFTYPAD에 나의 니케 표시하기\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">• SHIFTYPAD에 유니온 정보 표시하기</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">이 설정들을 모두 공개로 변경하지 않으면 정보 동기화가 불가능함.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg1.dcinside.com/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce88ffa1bd62531fb627d466152f0768651601e7f3d94f3c9adffb7d59ec2cb21d3f0d742dfc198c51beb2d33904e36c3af752eaf3975\" data-fileno=\"3674423\" style=\"width:366.546px;height:417px;\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046f5e459899ab\"></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">레츠도로 마이페이지로 돌아와 \"정보 동기화\" 버튼 클릭.</span></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg1.dcinside.com/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce88ffa1bd62531fb627d466152f0768651601e7f3d94f3c9adffb7d59ec2cb2bd5fbdf43dfcf9f29b2497d279bd599e849d885fb5b32\" data-fileno=\"3674424\" style=\"width:382.877px;height:304.5px;\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046f584b9f99ac\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">5. 완료 결과 창이 뜸.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">실패한 항목이 있으면, 어떤 설정이 안되어있는지 알려줄거니까 그거 보고 다시 ㄱㄱ</span></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg1.dcinside.com/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce88ffa1bd62531fb627d466152f0768651601e7f3d94f3c9adffb7d59ec2cb29d6fed448d7cf9a3a5c4a9ba3b9b06def27f184be4e42\" data-fileno=\"3674425\" style=\"width:373.767px;height:321px;\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046f594e9e97a9\"></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><b style=\"font-size:24px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">4. 협동작전 이용 가이드</span></b><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">이제 협전 사이트 기본 사용방법임.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">메인 페이지에서 \"티켓 발행\" 버튼을 클릭.</span></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg1.dcinside.com/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce88ffa1bd62531fb627d466152f0768651601e7f3d94f3c9adffb7d59ec2cb2ad2f1d543d0ce99f3a25ed05662b0c6f231a6d5ac9113\" data-fileno=\"3674426\" style=\"width:404.81px;height:401px;\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046c66f02a4d95e3\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">그럼 이런 창이 뜰텐데 다 입력하고 \"발행하기\" 버튼 클릭</span></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg1.dcinside.com/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce88ffa1bd62531fb627d466152f0768651601e7f3d94f3c9adffb7d59ec2cb29d4f0d040d1c59a842cfd8ca56b6c5cc0380ebac0d8ac\" data-fileno=\"3674427\" style=\"width:356.257px;height:355px;\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef0469963ff0b9f6\"><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">채팅방으로 와졌을텐데, 우상단의 \"공유\" 버튼 클릭.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg1.dcinside.com/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce88ffa1bd62531fb627d466152f0768651601e7f3d94f3c9adffb7d59ec2cb21d4fcd043d3c79e233ea360de9b2c240ecb0ddd314128\" data-fileno=\"3674428\" style=\"width:548.649px;height:406px;\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046ecd4dcef624\"></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">제목과 본문의 \"복사\" 버튼을 각각 눌러 복사한 후, 니마갤에 게시글을 작성.</span></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg1.dcinside.com/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce88ffa1bd62531fb627d466152f0768651601e7f3d94f3c9adffb7d59ec2cb2bd0fcd745d6c19a05ec39a0dbfa93e3bc4f89bf1adbda\" data-fileno=\"3674429\" style=\"width:430.592px;height:385px;\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046c66f72b4e9c\"></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg1.dcinside.com/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce88ffa1bd62531fb627d466152f0768651601e7f3d94f3c9adffb7d59ec2cb2ad5fdd444d7c29ee9355cf880a23f6fcb738dbf2e4d83\" data-fileno=\"3674430\" style=\"width:471.669px;height:379px;\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef04699238f2bcf1\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">주의: 절대 게시글에 협전 입장코드를 작성해선 안됨.</font></span>\n\n</span><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">협전 사이트는 인증된 사용자만 입장코드를 확인할 수 있도록 해서</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">무분별한 난입과 트롤링을 방지하기 위해 만들어진거임.\n\n게시글에 입장코드를 직접 작성하면 협뚜기의 무단 난입을 막을 수 없어 사이트를 사용하는 의미가 사라짐</span><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">입장코드는 반드시 채팅방 내에서만 공유되어야 함.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">협동작전을 시작하기 전, 우측 하단의 \"이륙\" 버튼을 눌러주면 좋음.</span></p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\">중간에 채팅방에서 나가지더라도, 이륙 시점의 참가자만 재입장이 가능하기에 혼선을 줄일 수 있음.</span><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg1.dcinside.com/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce88ffa1bd62531fb627d466152f0768651601e7f3d94f3c9adffb7d59ec2cb2fd5fcd047d1c5988e6795effb883e764d9feba9ad6d65\" data-fileno=\"3674431\" style=\"width:544.5px;height:404.852px;\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef0468e6a8efb860\"></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;font-size:medium;\"><br></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><a class=\"lnk\" href=\"https://letsdoro.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">https://letsdoro.com</span></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>피드백, 버그 제보, 기능 추가 요청은 이 글에서 계속 받음</p><p>댓글로 ㄱㄱ</p><p><br></p><p></p>",
  "snippet": "사이트 주소: https://letsdoro.com이걸 쓰면 어떤 장점이 있음?1. 협뚜기/트롤러 마주칠 일이 없어짐있다고 하더라도 바로 차단 가능 + 재가입 불가2. 채팅방에서 협투력과 오버 수치 확인 가능오버수치 높은 사람이 딜러잡을 수 있어서, 더 높은 점수 확보에 유리함.기존에 몇 트씩 해야했던걸 1트로 끝내는 경우가 많음.3. 채팅이 가능함그래서 ",
